Your turn. Say it with me. Although remote work offers flexibility, it can feel isolating.

15
00:01:47.661 --> 00:02:04.049
Remote work offers flexibility and a better work-life balance, without the daily commute. Working from a home office has benefits, but it can also lead to isolation, so virtual meetings help maintain connection and productivity.

16
