Home office!

19
00:02:14.207 --> 00:02:19.594
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:19.644 --> 00:02:20.876
Isolation!

21
00:02:22.111 --> 00:02:31.624
Think and answer. What is one advantage and one disadvantage of remote work?

22
